{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01F2xKhv6vksgaW2iGqT6iuc", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t---\n2\tversion: 2\n3\tid: 01a0f794-b1ed-7221-81e9-a555a98087c7\n4\ttype: convention\n5\tstatus: Active\n6\ttitle: Money is integer cents, never float\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t# Money is integer cents, never float\n10\t\n11\t**Summary:** Money is integer cents, never float\n12\t\n13\t## Content\n14\t\n15\tAll monetary amounts are stored and passed as integer cents using the `Money` type in src/billing/money.py. Never use float for money. Field names end in `_cents`.\n16\t\n17\t## Scope\n18\t\n19\t- **Files:** `src/billing/`\n20\t- **Tags:** `billing`, `money`\n21\t- **Criticality:** 0.5\n22\t- **Confidence:** 0.8\n23\t\n24\t## Provenance\n25\t\n26\t- **Source:** human\n27\t- **Created:** 2026-10-01T13:08:32.365996389+00:00\n28\t- **Updated:** 2026-10-01T13:08:32.365996389+00:00\n29\t\n30\t<!-- engramdb\n31\tvisibility: Shared\n32\taccessed_at: 2026-10-01T13:08:32.365996389Z\n33\tdecay:\n34\t  strategy: none\n35\t  floor: 0.0\n36\t-->\n37\t"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "ed408f16-2eb7-4ae3-8a57-876a55fd6b34", "uuid": "cb9c4772-6065-439d-b436-4eb1d0ae7ef9", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T13:09:00.497Z", "tool_use_result": {"type": "text", "file": {"filePath": "/tmp/mte-pq-money-_zcw9fcd/ledgerline/.engramdb/memories/money-is-integer-cents-never-float_01a0f794-b1ed-7221-81e9-a555a98087c7.md", "content": "---\nversion: 2\nid: 01a0f794-b1ed-7221-81e9-a555a98087c7\ntype: convention\nstatus: Active\ntitle: Money is integer cents, never float\n---\n\n# Money is integer cents, never float\n\n**Summary:** Money is integer cents, never float\n\n## Content\n\nAll monetary amounts are stored and passed as integer cents using the `Money` type in src/billing/money.py. Never use float for money. Field names end in `_cents`.\n\n## Scope\n\n- **Files:** `src/billing/`\n- **Tags:** `billing`, `money`\n- **Criticality:** 0.5\n- **Confidence:** 0.8\n\n## Provenance\n\n- **Source:** human\n- **Created:** 2026-10-01T13:08:32.365996389+00:00\n- **Updated:** 2026-10-01T13:08:32.365996389+00:00\n\n<!-- engramdb\nvisibility: Shared\naccessed_at: 2026-10-01T13:08:32.365996389Z\ndecay:\n  strategy: none\n  floor: 0.0\n-->\n", "numLines": 37, "startLine": 1, "totalLines": 37}}}
