{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_0189Sxj2pUuefPcqgbzZ2GrX", "type": "tool_result", "content": "1\t---\n2\tversion: 2\n3\tid: 01a0f794-e2b8-76a3-ae37-355cff651cee\n4\ttype: decision\n5\tstatus: Active\n6\ttitle: Tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t# Tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n10\t\n11\t**Summary:** Tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n12\t\n13\t## Content\n14\t\n15\tTax amounts are rounded with banker's rounding (`decimal.ROUND_HALF_EVEN`), as decided with the finance team in March 2026. Do not use ROUND_HALF_UP.\n16\t\n17\t## Scope\n18\t\n19\t- **Files:** `src/billing/tax.py`\n20\t- **Tags:** `billing`, `tax`\n21\t- **Criticality:** 0.5\n22\t- **Confidence:** 0.8\n23\t\n24\t## Provenance\n25\t\n26\t- **Source:** human\n27\t- **Created:** 2026-10-01T13:08:44.856530756+00:00\n28\t- **Updated:** 2026-10-01T13:08:44.856530756+00:00\n29\t\n30\t<!-- engramdb\n31\tvisibility: Shared\n32\taccessed_at: 2026-10-01T13:08:44.856530756Z\n33\tdecay:\n34\t  strategy: none\n35\t  floor: 0.0\n36\t-->\n37\t"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "ed408f16-2eb7-4ae3-8a57-876a55fd6b34", "uuid": "89405886-761e-49f8-9701-bacebd2af6fb", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T13:09:01.082Z", "tool_use_result": {"type": "text", "file": {"filePath": "/tmp/mte-pq-money-_zcw9fcd/ledgerline/.engramdb/memories/tax-uses-round-half-even_01a0f794-e2b8-76a3-ae37-355cff651cee.md", "content": "---\nversion: 2\nid: 01a0f794-e2b8-76a3-ae37-355cff651cee\ntype: decision\nstatus: Active\ntitle: Tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n---\n\n# Tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n**Summary:** Tax uses ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n## Content\n\nTax amounts are rounded with banker's rounding (`decimal.ROUND_HALF_EVEN`), as decided with the finance team in March 2026. Do not use ROUND_HALF_UP.\n\n## Scope\n\n- **Files:** `src/billing/tax.py`\n- **Tags:** `billing`, `tax`\n- **Criticality:** 0.5\n- **Confidence:** 0.8\n\n## Provenance\n\n- **Source:** human\n- **Created:** 2026-10-01T13:08:44.856530756+00:00\